idps-nr-offline-access = Stay signed in
idps-nr-offline-access-hint = Refresh tokens that keep working after the browser closes.
idps-nr-online-access = Refresh while signed in
idps-nr-online-access-hint = Refresh tokens that end with the user's session.
idps-not-offered = Not offered by this server's settings.

